</ol>
</li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2405.16444v3#S6" title="In CacheBlend: Fast Large Language Model Serving for RAG with Cached Knowledge Fusion"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Implementation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section">
<a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2405.16444v3#S7" title="In CacheBlend: Fast Large Language Model Serving for RAG with Cached Knowledge Fusion"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Evaluation</span></a>
